{"id":"huntik:page:2287","page_id":2287,"title":"The Legend of the Gargoyle","kind":"supporting_page","namespace":0,"summary":"The Legend of the Gargoyle was a mission that Dante Vale received from Guggenheim. Sophie Casterwill convinced him to turn it into a team effort so that she and Lok Lambert could accompany him for Foundation training. The team's mission was to unveil the myth of the Cave of the Gargoyle located on the Seine River in Rouen, France. They then needed to obtain the Titan Gar-Ghoul. The mission was ultimately unsuccessful, with DeFoe coming into possession of Gar-Ghoul; however, the Huntik team did find a map to the Paris Catacombs leading to the Ring of Arc.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:The_Legend_of_the_Gargoyle_Mission.png","wikitext":"File:The_Legend_of_the_Gargoyle_Mission.png","links":[]},"city":{"text":"Rouen, France","wikitext":"[[Rouen, France]]","links":[{"target_title":"Rouen, France","label":"Rouen, France","target_id":"huntik:page:8236","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rouen%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Rouen%2C%20France"}]},"location":{"text":"","wikitext":"","links":[]},"objectives":{"text":"Uncover the Cave of the Gargoyle\n Obtain the Titan, Gar-Ghoul.","wikitext":"Uncover the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]]<br> Obtain the Titan, [[Gar-Ghoul]].","links":[{"target_title":"Cave of the Gargoyle","label":"Cave of the Gargoyle","target_id":"huntik:page:2292","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Cave_of_the_Gargoyle","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2292"},{"target_title":"Gar-Ghoul","label":"Gar-Ghoul","target_id":"huntik:page:2150","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Gar-Ghoul","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2150"}]},"members":{"text":"Dante Vale \n Lok Lambert \n Peter \n Sophie Casterwill \n Zhalia Moon","wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Peter]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]","links":[{"target_title"