2","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"}]}],"start":0,"end":379}],"sections":[],"full_text":"The Legend of the Gargoyle was a mission that Dante Vale received from Guggenheim. Sophie Casterwill convinced him to turn it into a team effort so that she and Lok Lambert could accompany him for Foundation training. The team's mission was to unveil the myth of the Cave of the Gargoyle located on the Seine River in Rouen, France. They then needed to obtain the Titan Gar-Ghoul. The mission was ultimately unsuccessful, with DeFoe coming into possession of Gar-Ghoul; however, the Huntik team did find a map to the Paris Catacombs leading to the Ring of Arc.","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox mission\n| image      = File:The_Legend_of_the_Gargoyle_Mission.png\n| city       = [[Rouen, France]]\n| location   = \n| objectives =  Uncover the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]]<br> Obtain the Titan, [[Gar-Ghoul]].\n| members    = [[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Peter]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]\n| episode    = \"[[Into the River of Secrets]]\"\n}}\n\n'''The Legend of the Gargoyle''' was a mission that [[Dante Vale]] received from [[Guggenheim]]. [[Sophie Casterwill]] convinced him to turn it into a team effort so that she and [[Lok Lambert]] could accompany him for Foundation training. The team's mission was to unveil the myth of the [[Cave of the Gargoyle]] located on the [[Seine River]] in Rouen, France. They then needed to obtain the [[Titans|Titan]] [[Gar-Ghoul]]. The mission was ultimately unsuccessful, with [[DeFoe]] coming into possession of Gar-Ghoul; however, the Huntik team did find a map to the [[Paris Catacombs]] leading to the [[Ring of Arc]].\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions|Legend of the Gargoyle]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_title":"Rouen, France","label":"Rouen, France","target_id":"huntik:page:8236","target_url":"https:/